-- Seed data for the Fixed Values tables (sector, track, job_role,
-- skill, job, skill_proficiency, job_requires_skill, skill_weights)
-- and the Discovery Hub tables (job_family, work_type,
-- work_function, key_task). Extracted verbatim from
-- insert_schema.sql. Run this after
-- matchiq_selected_create_schema.sql, in this order, since later
-- tables reference earlier ones via foreign keys.
